Package: spells
Title: Persistent Excursions Beyond a Baseline-Relative Threshold
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Michael", "Sumner", email = "mdsumner@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A spell is a run of a series beyond a threshold set relative
    to a baseline, kept if it persists: a marine heatwave (Hobday et al.
    2016) is one, and so are cold spells, sea ice seasons, blooms and
    dry spells. The engine runs over a whole time x series matrix at
    once. Definitions are objects, and the behaviour of other packages
    is reproduced as named, versioned parity modes, tested against their
    stored outputs.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Imports: matrixStats
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
URL: https://github.com/hypertidy/spells
BugReports: https://github.com/hypertidy/spells/issues
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
